---
import StudioNav from "@components/StudioNav.astro";
import SiteShell from "@components/SiteShell.astro";
import { studioContact } from "@data/studio";
---

<SiteShell title="聯絡 KJyang Studio" description="Contact KJyang Studio for website design, frontend development, deployment, and maintenance." canonicalPath="/studio/contact">
  <main class="studio-index">
    <StudioNav />
    <section class="studio-contact-page">
      <div class="wrap contact-grid">
        <div>
          <span>Contact</span>
          <h1>想做網站，先聊需求和預算</h1>
          <p>可以用 LINE 或電話。先看你的行業、頁面需求、預算和上線時間，再判斷適不適合合作。</p>
          <aside class="line-contact-card studio-real-contact">
            <div class="line-qr" aria-label="KJyang Studio LINE QR code">
              <img src={studioContact.lineQr} alt="KJyang Studio LINE QR code" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <b>LINE / PHONE</b>
              <strong>{studioContact.lineId}</strong>
              <p>電話：{studioContact.phone}。可用 LINE 傳需求、參考網站和預算。</p>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <div class="action-row">
            <a class="btn studio-index-primary" href={studioContact.lineUrl}>LINE 聯絡</a>
            <a class="btn studio-index-secondary" href={`tel:${studioContact.phone}`}>電話聯絡</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <form class="contact-form" data-line-url={studioContact.lineUrl}><p>填好後複製需求，再開啟 LINE 貼上傳送。表單不會自動送出訊息。</p>
          <label class="field">
            姓名 / 店名
            <input name="name" autocomplete="name" />
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            行業
            <input name="industry" />
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            預算區間
            <select name="budget">
              <option>還不確定</option><option>NT$18,000 - 28,000</option>
              <option>NT$35,000 - 58,000</option>
              <option>需要客製功能</option>
              <option>還不確定</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            需求
            <textarea name="message" rows="5" required maxlength="3000"></textarea>
          </label>
          <button class="btn studio-index-primary" type="button">複製需求</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteShell>
